<title>USA: Smartek Inc buys Alternative Housing.</title>
<headline>Smartek Inc buys Alternative Housing.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smartek Inc  said on Wednesday it completed its acquisition of Alternative Housing Services Corp.</p>
<p>Alternative Housing Services specializes in providing affordable housing in low/moderate income areas, a news release issued by Smartek said.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed in the release.</p>
</text>
